# into this file.
# Added here: Cortello's Riddle (625), The Brassbolts Brothers (2769), ... and Bugs (1258).
# Since 2026-11-07 The Black Shield (1253, 1319, 1320) and Suspicious Hoofprints (1284) are done on the Theramore
# crossing at 33-34 (30-40/03).
# The Bloodsail Buccaneers (608) is taken on the level-48 Booty Bay stop (40-50/05).
# Left out: A Meal Served Cold (212): its 30-minute limit can't last from Stormwind to the
# Cold Eye Basilisks and back.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Theramore

step Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Morgan Stern stands near the inn; Helenia Olden, a trade supplier a few steps south, sells the spices Jarl wants.
  sethome "Theramore Isle"
  turnin 1260                         -- Morgan Stern, inside
  accept 1204
  accept 1265                         -- Commander Samaul, on the top floor of Foothold Citadel
  buy 3713 x3 npc 4897                -- Soothing Spices, for "Swamp Eye" Jarl

step Sentry Point
  tip Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at Sentry Point. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it.
  complete 1265 @59.9,40.9
  collect 5883 quest 1204             -- Forked Mudrock Tongue

step Archmage Tervosh
  tip Back in Theramore: Tervosh waits with Lady Jaina in the tower of Foothold Citadel.
  turnin 1265                         -- Upstairs
  accept 1266                         -- Upstairs

step Theramore
  turnin 1204                         -- Morgan Stern, inside
  accept 1258                         -- Morgan Stern: the crawlers are on the Swamp of Sorrows shore, keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Swamplight Manor
  tip Take the road north to the ruined manor; Jarl lives in the shack beside it and the loose dirt is at the corner of the house. Jarl wants three Soothing Spices: if you passed Helenia Olden, buy them from her in Theramore first.
  accept 1219                         -- Loose Dirt
  accept 1218                         -- "Swamp Eye" Jarl
  turnin 1218                         -- with the spices from Theramore
  accept 1206

step "Stinky" Ignatz
  tip Stinky waits west of the manor, in the marsh below North Point Tower. Lead him to his Bogbean leaves and keep the swamp creatures off him.
  accept 1222
  complete 1222 @48.9,24.6

step North Point Tower
  tip Private Hendel holds the tower with a few deserters. He turns on you: beat him until he yields.
  tip Careful: Hendel has two guards who join the fight when he turns hostile. The guards flee once he surrenders.
  turnin 1266                         -- Private Hendel
  accept 1324
  complete 1324

step Darkmist Cavern
  tip The Darkmist spiders nest around the cavern in the north-west of the marsh; every spider drops eyes.
  tip Careful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them.
  collect 5884 quest 1206             -- Unpopped Darkmist Eye

step Mudcrush Durtfeet
  tip Ride south to the giant's hut in the middle of the marsh.
  accept 1177

step The Shady Rest Inn
  tip The burned inn stands on the road west, toward the Barrens; the guard's badge lies in the ashes.
  accept 1252 @29.8,48.2              -- Theramore Guard Badge

