step Gorilla hills
  tip Ride inland to the Mistvale gorilla hills. Elder Mistvale Gorillas drop the giblets; Witch Doctor Unbagwa sits among them.
  accept 349                          -- Witch Doctor Unbagwa, inside Spirit Den
