  when onquest 93176
  tip An Arbor Tarantula crawls in the jungle south-east of Nesingwary's camp, on the way to the Rebel Camp: catch one with the tool from Amaryllis Webb's Entomology Starter Kit.
  collect 213566 "Arbor Tarantula Specimen" @43.1,16.7

