step Brother Nimetz
  turnin 205

step Panther Mastery
  when group 193
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Bhag'thera is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3876 quest 193.1 @49.4,24.0 map 1434

step Level 42.16 at Zul'Mamwe
  when !group 193
  when !group 197
  when !group 208
  when level<42.16
  tip Alone, you skip Nesingwary's three elite hunts: take their experience from the Skullsplitter trolls of Zul'Mamwe instead, just east of the mine, so every kill also counts for Kebok's tusks. Or, with a group, run the Uldaman dungeon instead.
  goto 45.5,36.5 map 1434 "Skullsplitter Warrior"
  level 42.16 grind 667                -- grind on Skullsplitter Warrior

step Ruins of Zul'Mamwe: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins just east of the mine; any of them can drop tusks, their panthers always do.
  tip Follow the road north-east to the Venture Co. camp at the Crystalvein Mine; the miners, surveyors and foremen drop the crystals.
  tip Careful: Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers and Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the area around the camp.
  collect 1524 quest 209              -- Skullsplitter Tusk
  collect 3917 quest 600              -- Singing Blue Crystal

