  tip At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Gnomes at Steelgrill's Depot, just east of Kharanos, beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour.
  train 7954 optional                 -- Binjy Featherwhistle
  vendor 7955 optional                -- Milli Featherwhistle: other colours, 20g

step Fly to Thelsamar
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Thelsamar"
  zone Loch Modan

step Loch Modan
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Ride east out of Dun Morogh through the tunnel into Loch Modan and on along the road to Thelsamar.
  goto 35.5,48.4 "Thelsamar"

step Thelsamar
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Ghak Healtouch is below ground in Thelsamar, by the inn. His mushrooms grow in the Uldaman dig in the Badlands; the next guide takes you there and back through Thelsamar.
  accept 17                           -- Ghak Healtouch, below ground

step Badlands
  zone Badlands
  goto 53.8,43.3 "Hammertoe's Digsite"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Badlands

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  zone Badlands
  tip Ride south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands; Sigrun Ironhew camps at the dig.
  turnin 733                          -- Sigrun Ironhew
  accept 706

step Garek
  tip Garek camps by himself in Dustwind Gulch, south-east of the digsite.
  accept 732
